TLDR

Using a Alfa AC1900 WiFi Adapter (https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZD7Z76?amp=&crid=2HY6YU1HZ234Z&amp=&sprefix=alfa+usb&linkCode=ll1&tag=dctm-20&linkId=e01a9f4013d15a4836acba0234c34c76&language=enUS&ref=asliss_tl) to broadcast the hotspot:

| Component | Purpose | Buy |
|---|---|---|
| Alfa AC1900 WiFi Adapter (https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZD7Z76?amp=&crid=2HY6YU1HZ234Z&amp=&sprefix=alfa+usb&linkCode=ll1&tag=dctm-20&linkId=e01a9f4013d15a4836acba0234c34c76&language=enUS&ref=aslisstl) | Long-range dual-band 802.11ac hotspot AP | Amazon (https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZD7Z76?amp=&crid=2HY6YU1HZ234Z&amp=&sprefix=alfa+usb&linkCode=ll1&tag=dctm-20&linkId=e01a9f4013d15a4836acba0234c34c76&language=enUS&ref=aslisstl) |
starting script: onstart.sh
Disable IPv6

sudo nano /etc/sysctl.conf
Install and Configure Pihole

curl -sSL https://install.pi-hole.net | PIHOLESKIPOS_CHECK=true sudo -E bash

setup the dhcp server to use 192.168.12.1 range.
